#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Form2"
msgstr "Form2"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "Current Snapshot"
msgstr "Huidige Kiek"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Thumbnail of the current snapshot"
msgstr "Duimnael van die huidige kiek"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"This is a thumbnail of the current snapshot.\n"
"\n"
"The image can be dragged to another application or document to copy the full "
"screenshot there. Try it with the Konqueror file manager!"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "&New Snapshot"
msgstr "Nuwe Kiek"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"This button creates a snapshot image of the screen.\n"
"\n"
"If the delay is set to \"No Delay\" the snapshot will be taken when you "
"click the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie knoppie skep 'n kiek beeld van die skerm.\n"
"\n"
"As die vertraging is stel na \"Nee vertraging\" die kiek sal wees geneem "
"wanneer jy kliek die muis."

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&Print Snapshot..."
msgstr "Druk Kiek..."

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "This button prints the snapshot."
msgstr "Hierdie knoppie druk die kiek."

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid "&Save Snapshot..."
msgstr "Stoor Kiek..."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "This button saves the snapshot to the \"Save As\" location below."
msgstr "Hierdie knoppie stoor die kiek na die \"Stoor As\" ligging onder."

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "Snapshot &delay:"
msgstr "Kiek vertraging:"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid " seconds"
msgstr " sekondes"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "No delay"
msgstr "Nee vertraging"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid "Snapshot delay in seconds"
msgstr "Kiek vertraging in sekondes"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"This is the number of seconds to wait after clicking the \"Take a new "
"snapshot\" button before taking the snapshot.\n"
"\n"
"This is very useful for getting windows, menus and other items on the screen "
"set up just the way you want.\n"
"\n"
"If no delay is set, the program will wait for a mouse click before taking a "
"snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is die nommer van sekondes na wag na te kliek die \"Neem 'n nuwe "
"kiek\" knoppie voor te neem die kiek.\n"
"\n"
"Hierdie is baie bruikbare vir verkry vensters, kieslyste en ander iteme op "
"die skerm stel begin net die weg jy wil hê.\n"
"\n"
"As nee vertraging is stel, die program sal wag vir 'n muis kliek voor te "
"neem 'n kiek."

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "&Only grab the window containing the pointer"
msgstr "Slegs gryp die venster bevat die wyser"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"Checking this option causes only the window that the mouse is over, when the "
"snapshot is taken, to be captured. Any other elements, including menus, "
"covering the window will appear as a black box in the snapshot."
msgstr ""

